<div><p>Integration Tests Suite pentru proiectul MyDrinkShop</p>
</div><a name="toc_tc30637"></a><p>&nbsp;</p><div> <table class="tc" width="90%" ><tr><th colspan="4">Test Case P232-65: TC_INT_01&nbsp;<span style="font-size: 80%;">[Version  : 1]</span></th></tr>
<tr><td width="20%" valign="top"><span class="label">Author:</span></td><td colspan="3">orir3584</td></tr>
<tr><td colspan="4"><span class="label">Summary:</span><br /><p>[Step 2] addProduct &ndash; produs valid trece prin validatorul real și este salvat &icirc;n repository<br />
<strong>Summary:</strong>&nbsp;Verifică integrarea dintre ProductService (S) și ProductValidator real (V); repository-ul (R) este mock.<br />
<br />
<strong>Steps:</strong></p>

<ol>
	<li>Creează un produs valid:&nbsp;<a href="vscode-file://vscode-app/c:/Users/raulo/AppData/Local/Programs/Microsoft%20VS%20Code/034f571df5/resources/app/out/vs/code/electron-browser/workbench/workbench.html" title="">id=1, name=&quot;Espresso&quot;, price=10.0, categorie=CLASSIC_COFFEE, tip=BASIC</a></li>
	<li>Apelează&nbsp;<a href="vscode-file://vscode-app/c:/Users/raulo/AppData/Local/Programs/Microsoft%20VS%20Code/034f571df5/resources/app/out/vs/code/electron-browser/workbench/workbench.html" title="">productService.addProduct(p)</a><br />
	<strong>Expected Result:</strong>&nbsp;Nicio excepție nu este aruncată;&nbsp;<a href="vscode-file://vscode-app/c:/Users/raulo/AppData/Local/Programs/Microsoft%20VS%20Code/034f571df5/resources/app/out/vs/code/electron-browser/workbench/workbench.html" title="">productRepo.save(p)</a>&nbsp;este apelat exact o dată.</li>
</ol>
</td></tr><tr><td colspan="4"><span class="label">Preconditions:</span><br /><p>ProductService instanțiat cu ProductValidator real și un mock Repository.</p>
</td></tr><tr><td width="20%" valign="top"><span class="label">Execution type:</span></td><td colspan="3">Automated</td></tr>
<tr><td width="20%" valign="top"><span class="label">Estimated exec. duration (min):</span></td><td colspan="3"></td></tr>
<tr><td width="20%" valign="top"><span class="label">Importance:</span></td><td colspan="3">Medium</td></tr>
<tr><td colspan="4"></td></tr><tr><td > name of the autotest class:</td><td  colspan = "3" >drinkshop.service.ProductServiceIntegrationStep2Test</td></tr>
<tr><td > name of the test method:</td><td  colspan = "3" >drinkshop.service.ProductServiceIntegrationStep2Test#addProduct_validProduct_savesViaRepo</td></tr>
<tr><td width="20%" valign="top"><span class="label">Requirements</span><td colspan="3">orir3584_F01:  AdaugareProdus [Version : 1]<br /></td></tr>
<tr><td width="20%" valign="top"><span class="label">Keywords:</span></td><td colspan="3">&nbsp;None<br/></td></tr>
</table>
</div>
<a name="toc_tc30639"></a><p>&nbsp;</p><div> <table class="tc" width="90%" ><tr><th colspan="4">Test Case P232-66: TC_INT_02&nbsp;<span style="font-size: 80%;">[Version  : 1]</span></th></tr>
<tr><td width="20%" valign="top"><span class="label">Author:</span></td><td colspan="3">orir3584</td></tr>
<tr><td colspan="4"><span class="label">Summary:</span><br /><p>[Step 2] addProduct &ndash; produs cu date invalide este respins de validatorul real; repository-ul nu este apelat<br />
<strong>Summary:</strong>&nbsp;Verifică că ProductValidator real (V) aruncă ValidationException pentru date invalide, &icirc;nainte ca Repository-ul mock (R) să fie apelat.<br />
<strong>Steps:</strong></p>

<ol>
	<li>Creează un produs invalid:&nbsp;<a href="vscode-file://vscode-app/c:/Users/raulo/AppData/Local/Programs/Microsoft%20VS%20Code/034f571df5/resources/app/out/vs/code/electron-browser/workbench/workbench.html" title="">id=0, name=&quot;ab&quot;, price=3.0, categorie=JUICE, tip=WATER_BASED</a></li>
	<li>Apelează&nbsp;<a href="vscode-file://vscode-app/c:/Users/raulo/AppData/Local/Programs/Microsoft%20VS%20Code/034f571df5/resources/app/out/vs/code/electron-browser/workbench/workbench.html" title="">productService.addProduct(p)</a><br />
	<strong>Expected Result:</strong>&nbsp;Este aruncată&nbsp;ValidationException;&nbsp;<a href="vscode-file://vscode-app/c:/Users/raulo/AppData/Local/Programs/Microsoft%20VS%20Code/034f571df5/resources/app/out/vs/code/electron-browser/workbench/workbench.html" title="">productRepo.save()</a>&nbsp;nu este apelat niciodată.</li>
</ol>
</td></tr><tr><td colspan="4"><span class="label">Preconditions:</span><br /><p><strong>Preconditions:</strong>&nbsp;ProductService instanțiat cu ProductValidator real și un mock Repository.<br />
&nbsp;</p>
</td></tr><tr><td width="20%" valign="top"><span class="label">Execution type:</span></td><td colspan="3">Automated</td></tr>
<tr><td width="20%" valign="top"><span class="label">Estimated exec. duration (min):</span></td><td colspan="3"></td></tr>
<tr><td width="20%" valign="top"><span class="label">Importance:</span></td><td colspan="3">Medium</td></tr>
<tr><td colspan="4"></td></tr><tr><td > name of the autotest class:</td><td  colspan = "3" >drinkshop.service.ProductServiceIntegrationStep2Test</td></tr>
<tr><td > name of the test method:</td><td  colspan = "3" >drinkshop.service.ProductServiceIntegrationStep2Test#addProduct_invalidName_throwsValidationException_repoNotCalled</td></tr>
<tr><td width="20%" valign="top"><span class="label">Requirements</span><td colspan="3">orir3584_F01:  AdaugareProdus [Version : 1]<br /></td></tr>
<tr><td width="20%" valign="top"><span class="label">Keywords:</span></td><td colspan="3">&nbsp;None<br/></td></tr>
</table>
