<a name="toc_tc30641"></a><p>&nbsp;</p><div> <table class="tc" width="90%" ><tr><th colspan="4">Test Case P232-67: TC_INT_03&nbsp;<span style="font-size: 80%;">[Version  : 1]</span></th></tr>
<tr><td width="20%" valign="top"><span class="label">Author:</span></td><td colspan="3">orir3584</td></tr>
<tr><td colspan="4"><span class="label">Summary:</span><br /><p>[Step 3] addProduct &ndash; produs valid este salvat și regăsit din repository-ul real<br />
<strong>Summary:</strong>&nbsp;Verifică integrarea completă S + V real + R real (in-memory); niciun mock.<br />
<strong>Steps:</strong></p>

<ol>
	<li>Creează un produs valid:&nbsp;<a href="vscode-file://vscode-app/c:/Users/raulo/AppData/Local/Programs/Microsoft%20VS%20Code/034f571df5/resources/app/out/vs/code/electron-browser/workbench/workbench.html" title="">id=1, name=&quot;Espresso&quot;, price=10.0, categorie=CLASSIC_COFFEE, tip=BASIC</a></li>
	<li>Apelează&nbsp;<a href="vscode-file://vscode-app/c:/Users/raulo/AppData/Local/Programs/Microsoft%20VS%20Code/034f571df5/resources/app/out/vs/code/electron-browser/workbench/workbench.html" title="">productService.addProduct(p)</a></li>
	<li>Apelează&nbsp;productService.findById(1)<br />
	<strong>Expected Result:</strong>&nbsp;<a href="vscode-file://vscode-app/c:/Users/raulo/AppData/Local/Programs/Microsoft%20VS%20Code/034f571df5/resources/app/out/vs/code/electron-browser/workbench/workbench.html" title="">findById(1)</a>&nbsp;returnează produsul adăugat; lista din repo conține exact 1 element.</li>
</ol>
</td></tr><tr><td colspan="4"><span class="label">Preconditions:</span><br /><p><strong>Preconditions:</strong>&nbsp;ProductService instanțiat cu ProductValidator real și AbstractRepository in-memory real.<br />
&nbsp;</p>
</td></tr><tr><td width="20%" valign="top"><span class="label">Execution type:</span></td><td colspan="3">Automated</td></tr>
<tr><td width="20%" valign="top"><span class="label">Estimated exec. duration (min):</span></td><td colspan="3"></td></tr>
<tr><td width="20%" valign="top"><span class="label">Importance:</span></td><td colspan="3">Medium</td></tr>
<tr><td colspan="4"></td></tr><tr><td > name of the autotest class:</td><td  colspan = "3" >drinkshop.service.ProductServiceIntegrationStep3Test</td></tr>
<tr><td > name of the test method:</td><td  colspan = "3" >drinkshop.service.ProductServiceIntegrationStep3Test#addProduct_validProduct_persistedInRepo</td></tr>
<tr><td width="20%" valign="top"><span class="label">Requirements</span><td colspan="3">orir3584_F01:  AdaugareProdus [Version : 1]<br /></td></tr>
<tr><td width="20%" valign="top"><span class="label">Keywords:</span></td><td colspan="3">&nbsp;None<br/></td></tr>
</table>
