<a name="toc_tc30643"></a><p>&nbsp;</p><div> <table class="tc" width="90%" ><tr><th colspan="4">Test Case P232-68: TC_INT_04&nbsp;<span style="font-size: 80%;">[Version  : 1]</span></th></tr>
<tr><td width="20%" valign="top"><span class="label">Author:</span></td><td colspan="3">orir3584</td></tr>
<tr><td colspan="4"><span class="label">Summary:</span><br /><p>[Step 3] addProduct &ndash; produs invalid nu este persistat &icirc;n repository-ul real<br />
<strong>Summary:</strong>&nbsp;Verifică că un produs care nu trece validarea reală nu ajunge &icirc;n repository-ul real.<br />
