<ol>
	<li>Creează un produs invalid:&nbsp;<a href="vscode-file://vscode-app/c:/Users/raulo/AppData/Local/Programs/Microsoft%20VS%20Code/034f571df5/resources/app/out/vs/code/electron-browser/workbench/workbench.html" title="">id=0, name=&quot;ab&quot;, price=3.0, categorie=JUICE, tip=WATER_BASED</a></li>
	<li>Apelează&nbsp;<a href="vscode-file://vscode-app/c:/Users/raulo/AppData/Local/Programs/Microsoft%20VS%20Code/034f571df5/resources/app/out/vs/code/electron-browser/workbench/workbench.html" title="">productService.addProduct(p)</a>&nbsp;&icirc;ntr-un bloc try-catch sau assertThrows</li>
	<li>Apelează&nbsp;<a href="vscode-file://vscode-app/c:/Users/raulo/AppData/Local/Programs/Microsoft%20VS%20Code/034f571df5/resources/app/out/vs/code/electron-browser/workbench/workbench.html" title="">productService.getAllProducts()</a><br />
	<strong>Expected Result:</strong>&nbsp;Este aruncată&nbsp;ValidationException;&nbsp;<a href="vscode-file://vscode-app/c:/Users/raulo/AppData/Local/Programs/Microsoft%20VS%20Code/034f571df5/resources/app/out/vs/code/electron-browser/workbench/workbench.html" title="">getAllProducts()</a>&nbsp;returnează o listă goală;&nbsp;<a href="vscode-file://vscode-app/c:/Users/raulo/AppData/Local/Programs/Microsoft%20VS%20Code/034f571df5/resources/app/out/vs/code/electron-browser/workbench/workbench.html" title="">findById(0)</a>&nbsp;returnează&nbsp;null.</li>
</ol>
</td></tr><tr><td colspan="4"><span class="label">Preconditions:</span><br /><p><strong>Preconditions:</strong>&nbsp;ProductService instanțiat cu ProductValidator real și AbstractRepository in-memory real.<br />
&nbsp;</p>
</td></tr><tr><td width="20%" valign="top"><span class="label">Execution type:</span></td><td colspan="3">Automated</td></tr>
